<title>USA: USDA offers Turkey $10 mln under GSM-103 for FY97.</title>
<headline>USDA offers Turkey $10 mln under GSM-103 for FY97.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The U.S. Agriculture Department authorized $10 million in credit guarantees for sales of U.S. farm goods to Turkey under the Intermediate Export Credit Guarantee Program (GSM-103) for fiscal 1997.</p>
<p>USDA said the commodities covered are breeder livestock, feeder cattle and poultry breeder stock.</p>
